// template: Sunday Piano
// order: 1
// Piano house: dotted piano stabs, offbeat bass, swung hats and congas, gospel choir.
title "Sunday Piano"
tempo 125
key f major
kick:    kick     round     x... x... x... x... | gain 0.9
clap:    clap     roomy     .... x... .... x...                                   | reverb small | gain 1.5
hat:     hat      closed    x x?0.6 x x x x?0.6 x x x x?0.6 x x x x?0.6 x x?0.7   | swing 0.15 | pan -0.2 | gain 0.45
ohat:    hat      open      ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x. | pan 0.2 | gain 0.93
shaker:  shaker   bright    x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7 x x?0.7   | swing 0.15 | gain 0.18 | pan 0.3
conga:   conga    slap      . . x . . x . . x . . . x . x x?0.5                   | swing 0.15 | pan -0.35 | reverb plate | gain 0.6
bell:    cowbell  classic   . . . . . . x . . . . . . x . x                       | pan 0.4 | gain 0.35
bass:    bass     rolling   . . bb1 . . . bb1 bb2 . . bb1 . . bb1 . . / . . c2 . . . c2 c3 . . c2 . . c2 . . / . . a1 . . . a1 a2 . . a1 . . a1 . . / . . d2 . . . d2 d3 . . d2 . . c2 . a1   | cutoff 1400 | drive 0.2 | duck 0.6 | gain 2
piano:   piano    house     Bbmaj9 . . Bbmaj9 . . Bbmaj9 . . . Bbmaj9 . . Bbmaj9 . . / C . . C . . C . . . C . . C . . / Am7 . . Am7 . . Am7 . . . Am7 . . Am7 . . / Dm9 . . Dm9 . . Dm9 . . . Dm9 . . Dm9 . .   | voicing open | delay 3/16 | reverb small | gain 0.5
organ:   organ    soft      Bbmaj9 ~ ~ ~ / C ~ ~ ~ / Am7 ~ ~ ~ / Dm9 ~ ~ ~       | lowpass 2400 | reverb wide | gain 0.11
strings: strings  ensemble  Bb ~ ~ ~ / C ~ ~ ~ / Am ~ ~ ~ / Dm ~ ~ ~               | brightness saw(8) 0.2..0.8 | reverb sea | gain 0.41
voice:   vox      ooh       f4 ~ ~ . d4 ~ f4 ~ / g4 ~ ~ ~ e4 ~ . . / e4 ~ ~ . c4 ~ e4 ~ / f4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ . .   | legato | glide 0.05 | delay 1/4 | reverb plate | gain 0.3
choir:   choir    gospel      Bb ~ ~ ~ / C ~ ~ ~ / Am ~ ~ ~ / Dm ~ ~ ~               | reverb sea | gain 0.24
rise:    noise    white     x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~                                   | cutoff saw(8) 300..9000 | gain saw(8) 0.15..0.5
riser:   riser    both      x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | length 15.5 | gain 0.5
down:    downlifter noise   x~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ ~~~~ / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.6
crash:   crash    short     x... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / .... / ....   | reverb wide | gain 0.45
section intro   kick hat shaker conga
section groove  kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bass piano | loop
section build   kick clap hat shaker conga strings piano rise riser
section drop    kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bell bass piano organ voice choir crash
section break   piano strings organ voice choir down
section groove2 kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bass organ voice
section drop2   kick clap hat ohat shaker conga bell bass piano organ strings voice choir crash
section outro   kick hat shaker conga
song intro 16, groove 32, build 8, drop 32, break 16, build 8, drop2 32, groove2 16, outro 16
